Subject: [PRIVATE] amdgpu: one-shot PS4 UVD readiness hypothesis

Default off. Retain complete owned VMID4 maps, require exact external firmware,
keep ring fetch disabled and park after either finite terminal outcome.
Public UVD5/6 field compatibility is a hypothesis; no decode qualification.
The external helper has a defensive local continuation for objtool.

